,"but, whatever he returns, "],["pg",""],["ls","wh"],["pc","h"],["hs","nh"],["at","you can win "],["pg",""],["ls","nh"],["pc","hk"],["pc","h"],["pc","h"],["pg",""],["hs","ws"],["at","and draw West's last trump. "],["pg",""],["ls","ws"],["pc","s"],["pc","c"],["pc","st"],["pc","s"],["pg",""],["hs","sd"],["at","You have lost three Diamonds "],["pg",""],["ls","sd"],["hs","ss"],["at","and two Spades, but you make your contract."],["pg",""],["up","32"],["ls","ss"],["hs","ws"],["hs","es"],["nt","\nDon't be reluctant to draw trump even if it means giving up the lead. Look at the above deal and see what would have happened if you had tried to take your winners before drawing all of the opponents' trumps. "],["pg",""],["ls","es"],["at","You would lose an extra trick needlessly when the opponents trumped "],["pg",""],["ls","ws"],["hs","sc"],["hs","nc"],["at","one of your winners."],["",""]]}}